prayerTemplate:
PRAYER

In the light of the facts and circumstances stated above, the Applicant most respectfully prays that this Hon'ble Court may graciously be pleased to:

a) Direct the Non-Applicant under Order 11 Rules 12 and 14 read with Section 30 and Section 151 CPC to disclose by affidavit and produce before this Hon'ble Court the documents specified in paragraph __ above, within such time as this Hon'ble Court may fix;

b) Permit the Applicant to inspect and take copies of the said documents under Order 11 Rule 15 CPC;

c) Direct the Non-Applicant to answer on affidavit the interrogatories annexed hereto under Order 11 Rule 1 CPC (if applicable);

d) Record that in the event of refusal / failure to produce, this Hon'ble Court may draw an adverse inference under Order 11 Rule 21 CPC;

e) Award costs of this application;

f) Pass any other order(s) as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit and proper in the interest of justice.

And for this act of kindness, the Applicant shall ever pray.
